{"name":"home","method":"GET","path":"/","status":200,"headers":{"content-type":"text/html; charset=UTF-8","cache-control":"public, max-age=0, s-maxage=3600, stale-while-revalidate=25200","vary":"Accept-Encoding","x-accel-expires":"3600","cache-tag":"page:starter"},"body":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>开始克隆 · AI 网站克隆模板</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Hono + htmx 4 网站克隆模板：先观察真实页面，再构建可编辑的本地实现。\">\n  <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#0f172a\">\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"http://localhost:3000/\">\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"开始克隆\">\n  <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Hono + htmx 4 网站克隆模板：先观察真实页面，再构建可编辑的本地实现。\">\n  <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"AI 网站克隆模板\">\n  <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"http://localhost:3000/\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/sites/starter/favicon.svg?v=7f6d60c8\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/app.css?v=ec5993d3\">\n  <script src=\"/static/htmx.js?v=fd25ba3f\" defer></script>\n  <script src=\"/static/alpine.js?v=b4036e9e\" defer></script>\n  <script src=\"/static/ext/hx-alpine-compat.js?v=09845071\" defer></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen antialiased\">\n<div class=\"starter-page\"><header class=\"starter-nav\"><a class=\"starter-brand\" href=\"/\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"starter-mark\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\"0.12\"></rect><path d=\"M10 20.5 16 9l6 11.5M12.8 16h6.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span>AI Website Cloner</span></a><nav class=\"starter-nav-links\" aria-label=\"主导航\"><a href=\"#stack\">技术栈</a><a href=\"#workflow\">工作流</a><a href=\"/demo\">交互示例</a><a href=\"https://github.com/JCodesMore/ai-website-cloner-template\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\">GitHub</a></nav></header><main class=\"starter-main\"><section class=\"starter-hero\"><div class=\"starter-hero-copy\"><div class=\"starter-eyebrow\"><span class=\"badge\" data-variant=\"secondary\">Hono + htmx 4</span><span>为 AI agent 准备的网站反编译底座</span></div><h1 class=\"starter-title\">Clone target<span class=\"starter-title-soft\">not yet built.</span></h1><p class=\"starter-lede\">这个模板已经迁移到无 React 的 Hono 技术栈。把目标 URL 交给 agent，先观察真实页面，再开始第一行代码。</p><div class=\"starter-command\"><code>/clone-website https://example.com</code><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"sm\" x-data=\"\" @click=\"navigator.clipboard?.writeText(&#39;/clone-website https://example.com&#39;)\">复制</button></div><div class=\"starter-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" data-size=\"lg\" href=\"/demo\">查看交互示例</a><a class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"lg\" href=\"#stack\">检查技术栈</a></div></div><aside class=\"starter-status-card\"><div class=\"starter-status-head\"><span>LIVE CHECK</span><span class=\"starter-status-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></div><p>这是一张由 Hono 生成的完整页面。点一下按钮，htmx 会取回一个 HTML fragment。</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"secondary\" hx-get=\"/fragments/ready\" hx-target=\"#fragment-status\" hx-swap=\"innerHTML\">运行自检</button><div id=\"fragment-status\" class=\"starter-fragment-slot\">尚未请求</div></aside></section><section id=\"stack\" class=\"starter-section\"><div class=\"starter-section-head\"><p class=\"starter-kicker\">STACK</p><h2>更少的运行时，更清楚的边界</h2></div><div class=\"starter-grid\"><article class=\"card starter-card\"><div class=\"starter-card-index\">01</div><h3>Hono 4.13</h3><p>显式路由、HTML fragment、Bun 与 Workers 共用同一份应用。</p></article><article class=\"card starter-card\"><div class=\"starter-card-index\">02</div><h3>htmx 4 + Alpine</h3><p>服务端返回视图；局部状态留给 Alpine，复杂交互再用原生 ESM。</p></article><article class=\"card starter-card\"><div class=\"starter-card-index\">03</div><h3>Tailwind v4 + Basecoat</h3><p>CSS-first 设计令牌与组件样式；不把 React 组件库带回来。</p></article></div><div class=\"starter-disclosure\" x-data=\"{ open: false }\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"starter-disclosure-trigger\" @click=\"open = !open\" :aria-expanded=\"open\"><span>为什么不用 JSX？</span><span class=\"starter-disclosure-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button><div class=\"starter-disclosure-panel\" x-show=\"open\" x-cloak=\"\" x-transition.opacity.duration.150ms=\"\"><p>克隆站的布局、首屏和内容主要来自 HTML 与 CSS。把页面表达为显式路由和字符串模板，agent 更容易定位、替换、验证，也更少被框架运行时干扰。</p></div></div></section><section id=\"workflow\" class=\"starter-section\"><div class=\"starter-section-head\"><p class=\"starter-kicker\">WORKFLOW</p><h2>先拿证据，再谈像素</h2></div><ol class=\"starter-steps\"><li class=\"starter-step\"><span class=\"starter-step-number\">01</span><div><h3>观察</h3><p>抓真实内容、字体、图片、响应式与状态证据。</p></div></li><li class=\"starter-step\"><span class=\"starter-step-number\">02</span><div><h3>分类</h3><p>区分 CSS 动画、Alpine 状态、htmx fragment 与独立 island。</p></div></li><li class=\"starter-step\"><span class=\"starter-step-number\">03</span><div><h3>构建</h3><p>在 src/sites/&lt;site&gt;/ 内实现页面、组件与 fragment。</p></div></li><li class=\"starter-step\"><span class=\"starter-step-number\">04</span><div><h3>对照</h3><p>同视口同状态比较，修最大差异，最后跑完整 CI。</p></div></li></ol></section></main><footer class=\"starter-footer\"><p>Hono + htmx 4 + Alpine + Tailwind v4 + Basecoat</p><p class=\"starter-footer-note\">像素级还原是目标；每一次交互都应该有证据。</p></footer></div>\n</body>\n</html>"}
